---- MODULE live_stops__unfair__let_formula ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLE x
Next == x < 2 /\ x' = x + 1
Spec == x = 0 /\ [][Next]_x
Prop == LET p == x = 1 IN <>p
====

